Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Ask for Resource Management's earn-back on the desk, and
 say plainly what the keys and questions are

The Lightkeeper's circle page loses its Refill button: the advance refills
the resources, and the squares stay as the correction, each press logged.
While an earn-back waits from a milestone, the circle page's resources and
the desk's charter abstract ask for the circle's choice (Stitch, Refresh or
Train, a full one cannot be picked) and one press applies it; the player's
circle page says one waits. The refill texts say the resources come back on
their own.

The Keys line reads "Investigators who fulfilled a key: 1 of 3 +2", with
what a key is and the 2 or 4 rule behind its i (the permanent subline is
gone), and the Illumination questions say they are answered together at the
end of an assignment, each yes adding 1 Illumination. The circle ability
removal confirm says "Press again to remove all circle abilities." and its
button is Remove.

Checked: vite build; in Chromium at 390x844, 820x1180 and 1366x768 on both
desks, a question added on the circle page passes milestone 3, the ask shows
with Refresh full and disabled, one press earns back a Stitch and logs it,
a square correction logs, the keys slip stays on the paper, the confirm
reads as asked, and no page errors.

